From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jon Pretty <jon.pretty@propensive.com>
Date: Fri, 17 Jul 2026 15:06:04 +0200
Subject: wasm: WASM and WIT compiler and library support

WASM/WIT code generation (dotty.tools.backend.sjs, transform.sjs) and the
scala.scalajs.wit library API. The vendored Scala.js IR and the scala-wasm
build config this needs now live on the main branch and are supplied by
bin/proscala-overlay at build time.

Developed with LLM assistance (Claude Code); reviewed by hand per LLM_POLICY.md.

Proscala-Patch: wasm
